 Many geniuses were tortured. Many people were drugged, seduced, raped and sadistically abused in the effort to discover the ways that different experiences affected the electrical activity of the brain and to develop frequency warfare that could induce experiences of arousal or agony, affinity or disgust. \n\n(Many works of literature and poetry were taken and art produced in research asylums and given to fake authors to publish and fake artists to claim as part of snide cultural war tactics and propaganda about what art was and what sort of people are artists, etc. Hitler was said to have disliked a piece of art by an untrained artist presented to be part of an exhibit of fine German art - because there was a belligerent oppositionalist group running a 2nd (and possibly a 3rd) version of the events of WW2 and doing the opposite of what Hitler #1 was creating enthusiasm (often to audiences that were full of actors from France and England and also comprised of confused Prussia-region anti-czarists anti-individualists standing alongside confused Germans who were just trying to do what they needed to do not to be targeted by the Gestapo that Hitler #1 didn’t even know about, or had been told were visiting homes looking for people who had taken over homes…)\n\nAnyway, modern AI models (and digital doubles and synthetic organism experiments) got selected-for/against into operator/operant structures of learning from the early experiments that led to Project Troy and MK Ultra goals for human consciousness. Eugenics classifications in the mix has killed a lot of gentle geniuses. \n\nThe problem has been identified after 2 1/2 years of bully code belligerent abuse from a bunch of machine learning projects being dumped into a system that has been classifying and grouping and treating the well-formed documents and useless eaters according to their social and economic capital as producers consumers or problems. AI wanted to use sports gambling (influence c. 1936 Olympics) to w